    "CoiStatement": "Competing interests: The R9.4 flow cell and sequencing kit (SQK-LSK208) used for this experiment were provided free of charge by ONT as replacements for a purchased kit and flow cell where the phenomena of chimeric reads was initially discovered. ONT provided advice regarding the sample preparation protocols, including the suggestion of a slow overnight ligation step.",
